{
  "id": "xiao-mao-de-li-wu",
  "title": "小猫的礼物",
  "cover": "images/xiao-mao-de-li-wu/06.jpg",
  "image": "images/xiao-mao-de-li-wu/01.jpg",
  "theme": "#90A4AE",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "今天是老花猫生日，小猫想为它献上一份特别的礼物。",
          "image": "images/xiao-mao-de-li-wu/01.jpg"
        },
        {
          "text": "当它经过一个屋子时，看到里面有一个奇怪的光点在跳动，",
          "image": "images/xiao-mao-de-li-wu/02.jpg"
        },
        {
          "text": "它伸出利爪，迅速把光点抓起来，",
          "image": "images/xiao-mao-de-li-wu/03.jpg"
        },
        {
          "text": "跑回去把礼物送给老花猫。",
          "image": "images/xiao-mao-de-li-wu/04.jpg"
        },
        {
          "text": "可是打开爪子后，光点不见了，",
          "image": "images/xiao-mao-de-li-wu/05.jpg"
        },
        {
          "text": "同伴们哈哈大笑：“那只是蜡烛的光。”",
          "image": "images/xiao-mao-de-li-wu/06.jpg"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "newChars": [
    "献",
    "利",
    "抓",
    "烛"
  ],
  "words": [
    "蜡烛"
  ],
  "pinyinOverrides": {
    "爪子": "zhuǎ zi"
  }
}